NOTE 2026-10-28T18:25:01Z: this run is SUPERSEDED by run 14. (1) The validator apply exposed a bug: audittrail counted dockerd/'s '-k pft-dockerd' watches as its own (61 loaded vs 55 in its file) and stopped before the journald step. (2) The agent fixed that bug in the working tree WHILE this run was still running, so the sentry part installed the working-tree script (sha256 fc421c38..., shown above), not commit f506217 (7cf62240...). Run 14 redeploys the committed fix on both hosts.
